config BR2_PACKAGE_THINGINO_LIGHTGUN_BENCH
	bool "thingino-lightgun-bench"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_MUSL if BR2_TOOLCHAIN_USES_MUSL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_UCLIBC if BR2_TOOLCHAIN_USES_UCLIBC
	help
	  Lightgun camera experiments:
	  - lgcap: native NV12 FrameSource capture benchmark (no encoder):
	    ISP and delivered frame rate, drops/duplicates, ISP->app
	    latency, optional threshold+CCL tracking workload, ISP scaler
	    channels, frame dumps for FOV comparison, LED-based
	    photon-to-app latency.
	  - lgbench: runs the standard lgcap matrix for one sensor mode.
